# Runtime data: the SQLite file, photos, backups — these never belong in the repo.
#
# With a leading slash, otherwise the pattern matches EVERY directory named "data" —
# including web/src/data with the leaps, milestones, WHO tables and country files. That
# is exactly what happened: a fresh clone would not have built.
/data/
/backups/

